# Real-tool failure-tail corpus for the 31-pattern runtime diagnostics engine.
# Each block: a `# intended=<pattern_id> exit=<code>` header, blank-line separated,
# followed by a realistic multi-line stderr/stdout tail harvested (and trimmed)
# from STAR/BWA/samtools/GATK/conda/docker/etc. output. A positive block MUST fire
# its intended pattern. See crates/oxo-flow-core/tests/diagnostic_corpus.rs.

